<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Sawai Madhopur | Secure Two-Wheeler Shifting Rajasthan
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How should I prepare my bike before scheduling bike transportation in Sawai Madhopur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Before the shift, empty the fuel tank to less than 5 %, disconnect the battery, and secure any loose accessories. Clean the bike to expose any pre‑existing scratches, then document its condition with photos. Our team will also perform a pre‑load inspection and note any existing damages, ensuring a transparent hand‑over.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for booking a bike parcel through IRCTC from Sawai Madhopur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a signed consignment note, and an e‑Way bill for interstate moves. If you are using IRCTC’s bike parcel service, the IRCTC parcel form and a copy of the train ticket (or booking reference) are also mandatory.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the transit insurance for bike transportation in Sawai Madhopur truly full‑value, and how do I claim?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we provide IRDAI‑approved full‑value insurance covering the declared market price of your bike. In the unlikely event of damage, file a claim within 48 hours, submit the inspection report, photos, and original invoice. Our claims team coordinates with the insurer to settle the payout promptly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical cost breakdown for bike transportation from Sawai Madhopur to Delhi NCR?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost includes a base freight charge based on distance (≈ 850 km), a hydraulic carrier surcharge, packaging fee for 7‑layer cushioning, insurance premium (1‑2 % of declared value), and GST. Additional services such as doorstep pickup or expedited delivery are optional and quoted separately.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it take for a bike to travel from Sawai Madhopur to major hubs like Mumbai or Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies with distance and road conditions. Typically, Sawai Madhopur → Mumbai (≈ 1,200 km) takes 2‑3 days, while Sawai Madhopur → Bangalore (≈ 1,600 km) requires 3‑4 days. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress and receive alerts for any unexpected delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures prevent scratches or dents during the loading and unloading of my bike?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp carriers feature anti‑slip rubber mats and padded wheel chocks. Trained technicians use custom wooden crating and 7‑layer cushioning, and each bike is secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings. A pre‑ and post‑load inspection ensures any damage is recorded before movement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it is being transported from Sawai Madhopur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every carrier is equipped with a GPS unit linked to our client portal. You receive live location updates, estimated arrival times, and instant alerts for route deviations or stoppages. This transparency gives you peace of mind throughout the entire journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
